# Secure Healthcare Platform – Walkthrough

## Summary

The **Secure Healthcare Data Sharing Platform (HealthVault)** is now fully completed. All code is production-ready with all original requirements implemented.

---

## What Was Built

### Backend (Node.js + Express + Prisma)
| Component | Files | Description |
|-----------|-------|-------------|
| **Auth** | [authController.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/controllers/authController.js), [auth.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/frontend/src/lib/auth.js) middleware, [mfaService.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/services/mfaService.js) | JWT auth with TOTP MFA |
| **Records** | [recordController.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/controllers/recordController.js), [encryptionService.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/services/encryptionService.js), [abeService.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/services/abeService.js) | AES-256-GCM encrypted medical records with envelope encryption |
| **Consents** | [consentController.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/controllers/consentController.js), `consentCheck.js` | Patient-controlled access with TTL |
| **Audit** | [auditController.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/controllers/auditController.js), [auditService.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/services/auditService.js), [blockchainService.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/services/blockchainService.js) | SHA-256 hash-chain blockchain |
| **Admin** | [adminController.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/controllers/adminController.js), [rbac.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/middleware/rbac.js) | Role-based dashboard & user management |
| **API Docs** | [app.js](file:///Users/taranjain/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/healthcare-platform/backend/src/app.js) (Swagger) | OpenAPI 3.0 at `/api-docs` |

### Frontend (Next.js 14 + Tailwind CSS)
| Page | Route | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| Landing | `/` | Hero, features, CTA |
| Login | `/login` | Email/password + MFA flow |
| Register | `/register` | With role selection + auto MFA setup |
| MFA Setup | `/mfa` | QR code-based TOTP configuration |
| Patient Dashboard | `/dashboard/patient` | Upload records, manage consents, view audit |
| Doctor Dashboard | `/dashboard/doctor` | View accessible records, consent status |
| Admin Dashboard | `/dashboard/admin` | System stats, user management, blockchain verify |

### Infrastructure
- **Docker Compose**: PostgreSQL 15, Redis 7, Backend, Frontend
- **Database**: Prisma ORM with auto-migration and seed script
- **Security**: Helmet, CORS, rate limiting, input validation

